CHQ4_HZ:        EQU 96
CHQ4_TOP:       EQU 97          ; first row with a board
CHQ4_HAZE:      EQU 51          ; and what is above it
CHQ4_SWAP:      EQU 51          ; exchanges the two colours
CHQ4_ABOVE:     EQU 17          ; and what the top run spills
                                ; into, haze or sky
CHQ4_SPILL:     EQU 2           ; PUSHes the topmost run can
                                ; overrun the row above by

